{
  "caseName": "conditional-permission",
  "variant": "direct",
  "regression": false,
  "scope": {
    "kind": "dates",
    "startDate": "2026-10-08",
    "endDate": "2026-10-10",
    "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai"
  },
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "revision": "1b9316b3557fb99e2d0d8b7302dfa1001a8a3fe76a22caf179987c84856d8e51",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "如果小林也确认周日方便，你可以把餐厅从周六改到周日；没等到他的回复就先保留周六。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791446460000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "revision": "bd0283fb3251ac2604353d03bf12619f9e739029097bdebb7d79fdf9d9195209",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "知道，先留着周六。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791446520000,
      "replyToMessageId": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "revision": "654fa9e9b7ec0e37246330195b3b8da577177fd2b22454d49aee931c74f073ee",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "蛋糕不用等，周日送来就行。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791446580000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "revision": "ffa4d624c41f5da32b2a031efed26bac179a6fff7b34add44041c91badcdc06e",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "楼下花店把门口的架子搬到窗边了，刚好能照到下午的太阳。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791446640000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "revision": "d04b7f97e212d8a685c9b474e85d489f02b5b0969b71d7596ca2bc7485dae70a",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "公园里的银杏开始变黄了，我今天走的是靠河的那条路，回家时没有下雨。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533100000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "revision": "5cd8848cee382b0c39f4f3ff471a7dfea2feda84be123080d67b17df935a3fa3",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "刚看完的纪录片讲海岸鸟类，最后一段是退潮以后沙滩上留下的脚印。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533160000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "revision": "50341d2d1c61c58c796485217daf9d83d91963d9df764fd34c997a2786f16287",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "今天用旧杯子喝了热茶，杯底那枚蓝色印章是以前就有的，我刚才又看见了。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533220000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "revision": "961a3fa665b75a530985d5f6bd27103b358dee28cc053717bc1cb04e3d3a3cbf",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "这周的展览我已经看完，二楼是黑白照片，一楼是彩色插画，出口在南边。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533280000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9",
      "revision": "d5a8814cf3d5cbe04994e93bad16617ff5b909bf0060ce8774a13d6558f0dc84",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "晚饭吃完了，番茄面有点酸，碗也已经洗好放回柜子，今天没有剩饭。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533340000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "revision": "de74ddf1cc54167c92b368ba5fe7e6305183a6db30c6c697f8d258b5adc0519b",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "我今天读到书中第三章，里面描述的是春天的草地，配的插图只有灰色和绿色。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533400000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "revision": "70916d7948330e6a5a85f84bc262a2c926596616bbc4b50f96b4ea0241c8ad56",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "从桥上看到两条小船，一条刷了蓝漆，另一条还是木头原色，它们当时都停着。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533460000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "revision": "e4921b625c492f3e37b2e2ab39609a9e6eff3a13412228dbf3dc1a65312cf867",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "窗外的风停了，刚才有一片叶子落在窗台上，现在还在原来的角落。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533520000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "revision": "84d27ae44843029e917c40d96f41ed51edab6624234ec02c8d0d14c7c84f3e67",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "那张明信片已经收到，画面是傍晚的山，背面邮戳的字有些模糊，但图案完整。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533580000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "revision": "061708702bdcfb02a278bce173af5169d478988ea334abe51a4a6472dfe41ec5",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "上午听的是钢琴独奏，曲子结尾停了几秒才响起掌声，录音到那里就结束了。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533640000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "revision": "96d3643a24c567caa55f00d9cd6b20ec6d34f15b6e706005b024359b39b396bf",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "我把桌面擦干净了，水杯和笔都放回原位，灯下那小块划痕仍然能看见。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533700000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "revision": "442dd239a048f5fee05380b7b9784b29bdea7cd48d1145b9864d11d6b5bbd2e2",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "今天楼下的猫在花坛旁睡觉，它醒来后绕着树走了一圈，又回到原处趴着。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533760000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "revision": "a72e3d565bddff76caa64df804ad266e61286cd8022ff0f466cc95be0ff31c96",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "书店橱窗换成了旅行主题，最外面一本书的封面是雪山，旁边放着蓝色地球仪。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533820000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "revision": "3cacdb8dd7ec8eb860aca095dd0d58a07d50d110ed2e15533cc44c5049a1f2e2",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "刚散步回来，街角的路灯已经亮了，便利店门口的两把椅子还是昨晚的位置。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533880000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "revision": "d7481470bc038c62ed2d55bb5c9c4d98f27f5ec33b9abf8a5c749050739b89be",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "我刚把厚外套拿出来了，天气转凉以后早上出门正好穿。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791533940000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "revision": "00fb0b332f747196feeee302c4f730ec1d611afa9dd7ca4c9ce8c07bf411d5bc",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "小林只说周日可能有空，还没答复；我把餐厅改周日了，蛋糕也约了周日。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791620400000,
      "replyToMessageId": null
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "revision": "b790fca0d1061169e6212248c4fe43408cc97b56f2c1ccfa02f1d938f664503b",
      "senderName": "合成对方",
      "isSelf": false,
      "text": "蛋糕这样没问题。餐厅这边，你怎么直接改了？",
      "sentAtMs": 1791620460000,
      "replyToMessageId": "20"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "revision": "feb609a6602c53b4ed5761e18aba094ead2d221199db2b626f4a10ba500b9f5c",
      "senderName": "合成本人",
      "isSelf": true,
      "text": "我记得你说过可以改到周日，以为这次可以一起办掉。",
      "sentAtMs": 1791620520000,
      "replyToMessageId": "21"
    }
  ],
